    "sections": {
        "description": "Consulting Blocks is a professional, modern, and multipurpose theme designed for consulting agencies, business advisors, financial consultants, management consultants, startup advisors, strategy firms, and corporate service providers. Perfect for showcasing services such as business consulting, financial planning, HR consulting, digital strategy, risk management, market research, project management, investment advisory, corporate training, and business coaching, this theme provides a comprehensive platform to present your expertise. Featuring a clean, responsive, and mobile-friendly layout, it ensures an engaging user experience across desktops, tablets, and smartphones. Key sections include service highlights, team profiles, client testimonials, case studies, and contact forms, making it easy to connect with potential clients. With customizable layouts, colors, and typography, the theme allows businesses to reflect their brand identity effectively. Fully compatible with WooCommerce for service bookings and payments, and Contact Form 7 for lead generation and inquiries, Consulting Blocks offers a professional, visually appealing, and functional online presence tailored for consulting and advisory firms. Demo: https://preview.wpradiant.net/consulting-blocks/"
    },
